{"ID":"20240205165627-2b21tgg","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"custom-sy-readonly":"true","id":"20240205165627-2b21tgg","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205165627-2b21tgg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206105502-k3apwkr\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240607123238-7pa5i6n\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:2800,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619113210-jllu712\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:7,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:7\u0026#125;","title":"059肉苁蓉（肉松蓉、大芸）","type":"doc","updated":"20240806170753"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206105502-k3apwkr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105502-k3apwkr","updated":"20240206105509"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产于内蒙古、新疆、陕西等地。\n【性状】\t肉苁蓉：呈扁圆柱形，稍弯曲，长 35cm，直径28cm，表面棕褐色或灰棕色。密被覆瓦状排列的肉质鳞叶，通常鳞叶先端已断。体重、质硬，微有柔性，不易折断，断面棕褐色，有淡棕色点状维管束，排列成波状环纹。气微味甜、微苦。\n管花肉苁蓉：呈扁圆柱形、扁纺锤形、扁卵圆形、扁圆形等不规则形，长68cm，直径46.5cm，表面红棕色、灰黄棕色或棕褐色，多扭曲。密被略呈覆瓦状排列的肉质鳞片，上部密下部疏、鳞片先端多已断落，残基部宽多在l厘米以上，整个鳞片略呈长三角形，高约1cm。体重、质坚硬，无韧性，难折断，断面颗粒性，多呈灰棕色，有的外圈呈黑色硬胶质样。黑褐色点状维管束众多，不规则散在，有的有小裂隙。气微，味甜、微苦。\n【性味】\t甘、咸，温。\n【功效】\t具有补肾阳，益精血，润肠通便的功效。主治肾阳虚衰，精血亏损，阳痿，遗精，腰膝冷痛，耳鸣目花，带浊，尿频，月经愆期，崩漏，不孕不育，肠燥便秘。\n【炙品】\t酒苁蓉：取苁蓉片，用黄酒拌匀，置罐内密闭，坐水锅中，隔水加热蒸至酒尽为度，取出，晾干 (每肉苁蓉100斤，用黄酒30斤) 。增强温阳作用。\n黑豆制：取肉苁蓉用米泔水漂泡3天，每天换水1次，去尽咸味，刮去表面鳞叶，切1.5cm厚的片；然后取黑豆5kg炒香，分成3份，每次取1份掺水和肉苁蓉用微火煮干，取出至半干，再蒸透后晒干，另取黑豆1份同煮，蒸晒，反复3次，晒干即可，每肉苁蓉500kg，用黑豆50kg。增强补肾益精作用。\n【附注】\t肉苁蓉 (Cistanche deserticola) 已被列入《濒危野生动植物种国际贸易公约》 (CITES) 附录二中。该物种虽可进行贸易，但须受许可证制度管制。"}]},{"ID":"20240206105502-z9i3otk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206105502-z9i3otk","updated":"20240206105502"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206105502-26d75de.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240205165924-o0cxc9p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240205165924-o0cxc9p","updated":"20240205165924"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉-20240205165924-rpafjtg.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806170100-vnqbxfg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806170100-vnqbxfg","updated":"20240806170100"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 481px;","style":"width: 471px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉-20240806170100-8zynvvu.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 471px;\" parent-style=\"width: 481px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806170608-r7mhkgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806170608-r7mhkgp","updated":"20240806170753"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 787px;","style":"width: 777px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉2"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉2-20240619112600-ejzjti2.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 777px;\" parent-style=\"width: 787px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 447px;","style":"width: 437px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉 (4)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉 4-20240806170753-qnsei38.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 437px;\" parent-style=\"width: 447px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240619113210-jllu712","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240619113210-jllu712","updated":"20240806170128"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 788px;","style":"width: 778px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉5"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉5-20240619113341-965yf6o.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 778px;\" parent-style=\"width: 788px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 449px;","style":"width: 439px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉4"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉4-20240619113209-7xojkup.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 439px;\" parent-style=\"width: 449px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240806170419-diusdj7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240806170419-diusdj7","updated":"20240806170531"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 805px;","style":"width: 795px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉 (1)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉 1-20240806170419-6q89cak.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 795px;\" parent-style=\"width: 805px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 425px;","style":"width: 415px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"肉苁蓉 (2)"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/肉苁蓉 2-20240806170531-yui8siq.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 415px;\" parent-style=\"width: 425px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240616132407-wbefuvp","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132407-wbefuvp"}},{"ID":"20240616132802-f2eydq5","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-f2eydq5","updated":"20240616132811"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉松蓉《神农本草经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-o8vdm1i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-o8vdm1i","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微温。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-nivb1iy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-nivb1iy","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子，妇人症瘕。久服轻身。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-cl2scm3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-cl2scm3","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《吴普》曰：肉苁蓉，一名肉松蓉，神农黄帝咸，雷公酸小温（《御览》作李氏小温），生河西（《御览》作东），山阴，地，长三四寸丛生，或代郡（览御下有雁门二字），二月至八月，采（《御览》引云，阴干用之）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-ssadhqx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-ssadhqx","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《名医》曰：生河西及代郡雁门，五月五日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-0ltllxa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-0ltllxa","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"案《吴普》云：一名肉松蓉，当是古本，蓉即是容字，俗写苁蓉，非正字也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132802-23ne24y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132802-23ne24y","updated":"20240616132802"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶宏景云：是野马精落地所生，生时似肉，旧作肉苁蓉，非。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132816-u3p67y6","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132816-u3p67y6"}},{"ID":"20240616132817-mi3snoz","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132817-mi3snoz","updated":"20240616132840"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《名医别录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132817-oujeczg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132817-oujeczg","updated":"20240616132817"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味酸、咸，无毒．除膀胱邪气、腰痛，止痢．生河西及代郡雁门．五月五日采，阴"}]},{"ID":"20240616132817-iowxfnf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132817-iowxfnf","updated":"20240616132822"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》原文∶肉苁蓉，味甘，微温．主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气多子，妇症瘕。久服轻身。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132842-aqa463h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132842-aqa463h"}},{"ID":"20240616132843-bqzkdvt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132843-bqzkdvt","updated":"20240616132847"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《神农本草经百种录》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132843-0t7grvv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132843-0t7grvv","updated":"20240616132843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶是马精落地所生，后有此种则蔓延者也。味甘，微温。主五劳七伤，补中，补诸精虚之证。除茎中寒、热痛，茎中者，精之道路也。精虚，则有此痛，补精则其病自已矣。养五脏，强阴益精气，多子，五脏各有精，精足则阴足，而肾者又藏精之所也，精足则多子矣。妇人症瘕。精充则邪气消，咸能软坚也。久服，轻身。精足之功。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132843-7h4579w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132843-7h4579w","updated":"20240616132843"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"此以形质为治也，苁蓉象人之阴，而滋润粘腻，故能治前阴诸疾，而补精气。如地黄色质象"}]},{"ID":"20240616132704-wme28vn","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132704-wme28vn"}},{"ID":"20240616132714-30eanf7","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132714-30eanf7","updated":"20240616132717"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《医学入门》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132714-1ezz2tw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132714-1ezz2tw","updated":"20240616132714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉补右肾精，阴痿非此不能兴，止茎中痛强筋髓，妇人崩带与瘕 。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132714-mp4i7vo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132714-mp4i7vo","updated":"20240616132714"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马精落地所生，初生似肉。味甘、酸、咸，微温。盖其性从容和缓。无毒。补右命门相火不足，男子绝阳不兴，泄精，尿血，遗溺，下痢，止茎中寒热痛，膀胱邪气，强筋髓，暖腰膝，止腰痛。又治妇人血崩带下、瘕、阴痛、绝阴不产。丹溪云∶峻补精血，骤用反致动火便滑。酒浸一宿，刷去浮甲及心中白膜，如竹丝草样，不尔，令人上气不散。酒蒸，或酥涂炙，根名琐阳，味甘、咸，气温，无毒。闭精，补阴气。虚而大便燥结者，煮粥食之，不燥者勿用。入药炙。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132704-afm7dx4","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132704-afm7dx4"}},{"ID":"20240616132705-wnuwhp0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-wnuwhp0","updated":"20240616132709"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-xhogb57","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-xhogb57","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「释名」亦名肉松容、黑司命。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-61xkfuy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-61xkfuy","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「气味」甘、微温、无毒。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-hs129w4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-hs129w4","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"「主治」"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-h51mlne","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-h51mlne","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1、劳伤，精败面黑。用肉苁蓉四两，水煮烂，切薄研细，炖羊肉吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-ldowvo4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-ldowvo4","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2、肾虚白浊。用肉苁蓉、鹿茸、山药、白茯苓，等分为末，加米糊做成丸子，如梧子大，每服三十丸，枣汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-dkc9bfv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-dkc9bfv","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3、汗多便秘（年老或体虚的病人）。用肉苁蓉（酒浸，焙过）二两、沉香末一两，共研为末。加麻子杜汁糊成丸子，如梧子大。每服七、八丸。白开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-obgkbae","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-obgkbae","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4、消中易饥（按：患此病者常多食，但身体很消瘦）。用肉苁蓉、山萸、五味子等分，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服二十丸，盐酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132705-g4bsseg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132705-g4bsseg","updated":"20240616132705"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5、破伤风（口禁，身强直）。用肉苁蓉切片晒干，烧成烟熏伤处，累效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132416-wh6c7p7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132416-wh6c7p7"}},{"ID":"20240616132417-wtxro06","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132417-wtxro06","updated":"20240616132422"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草择要纲目》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132417-503sjdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132417-503sjdl","updated":"20240616132417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【气味】"}]},{"ID":"20240616132417-4bosgu6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132417-4bosgu6","updated":"20240616132417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"干微温无毒．（酒浸一宿．刷去砂土浮甲．劈破中心．去白膜一重如竹丝草样．复以甑蒸之．从午至酉．又用酥炙得所．方可入丸．）命门相火不足者．以此补之．乃肾经血分药也．"}]},{"ID":"20240616132417-dlx2rqt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132417-dlx2rqt","updated":"20240616132417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】"}]},{"ID":"20240616132417-56rhek6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132417-56rhek6","updated":"20240616132417"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五痨七伤．补中．除茎中寒热痛．强阴益精．女子带下阴痛．但属土而有水与火．虽能峻补精血．骤多用之．则反滑大肠．"}]},{"ID":"20240616132438-3s25agv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132438-3s25agv"}},{"ID":"20240616132439-ywrojcf","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-ywrojcf","updated":"20240616132443"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草简要方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-k54u6j6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-k54u6j6","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产河套者良。沿河野生。土人采之。煮粥同食。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-mm418bk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-mm418bk","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"主治补肾。润肠滋阴益精阳痿。遗泄。妇人绝阴不产。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-an5cij4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-an5cij4","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苁蓉丸。苁蓉（酒浸一宿刮去皱皮炙干）菟丝子（酒浸三日曝干别研为末。）各二两。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-0hwxokk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-0hwxokk","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"熟地钟乳粉天雄（泡去皮）五味子桂心人参干姜（炮）白术远志（去心）杜仲（去心皮炙黄）巴戟（去心）牛膝（去苗）山茱萸（去核）覆盆子川椒（去目及合口者炒出汗。）各一两。炙草五钱。天门冬（去心焙）一两五钱。研末。蜜丸梧子大。每服三十丸。空腹温酒下。益精神。壮气血。驻容颜。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-bqgs3uu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-bqgs3uu","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"乌须发。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-55apa4a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-55apa4a","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又方。苁蓉八两。熟地六两。五味子四两。菟丝子（捣碎）二两。研末。酒煮山药和丸梧子大。每服七十粒。盐汤或酒空腹下。治禀赋虚弱。小便频数。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-swnhoa8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-swnhoa8","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苁蓉五子丸。苁蓉（酒浸）四两。生熟地各三两。菟丝子蛇床子覆盆子枸杞子车前子各二两。白茯苓三两。续断生黄破故纸各一两五钱。研末。蜜丸梧子大。每空腹服五七十丸。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-18h44dv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-18h44dv","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"广嗣衍家。精滑者加龙骨五味子各一两。阳衰者加淫羊藿一两。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132439-sn6stgp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132439-sn6stgp","updated":"20240616132439"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按此药补而不峻。故名从容。列当锁阳。功用相同而列当较弱。（亦有润肠消炎之功。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132504-kcpwtk1","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132504-kcpwtk1"}},{"ID":"20240616132504-84thzwu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132504-84thzwu","updated":"20240616132510"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《吴普本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132504-n5mu0fr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132504-n5mu0fr","updated":"20240616132504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《御览》卷九百八十九"}]},{"ID":"20240616132504-338yg2t","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132504-338yg2t","updated":"20240616132504"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"一名肉松蓉。神农、黄帝∶咸。雷公∶酸。李氏∶小温。生河东山阴地。长三、四寸，生。或代郡、雁门。二月至八月采，阴干用之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132516-i9bl2ju","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132516-i9bl2ju"}},{"ID":"20240616132517-xqga024","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132517-xqga024","updated":"20240616132521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《顾松园医镜》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132517-d76vwe2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132517-d76vwe2","updated":"20240616132517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔甘咸微温，入肾经。大至斤许，不腐者佳，酒洗去甲。〕益精壮阳事，补血润大肠。〔若骤用之，反动便滑，故独用二三两，顿饮，治血枯便燥有神。〕滋肾峻补精血之要药。锁阳功用相仿，可代苁蓉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132517-8vq59fu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132517-8vq59fu","updated":"20240616132517"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"苁蓉性滑，泄泻禁用，阳易举而精不固者勿服。锁阳禁忌亦同。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132538-30t7exv","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132538-30t7exv"}},{"ID":"20240616132541-qwhj6l6","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132541-qwhj6l6","updated":"20240616132547"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草分经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132541-lluvwrl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132541-lluvwrl","updated":"20240616132541"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸咸温，入肾经血分，补命门相火，润五脏益精血滑肠，功用与琐阳相仿，草苁蓉力稍劣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132552-psmyf3h","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132552-psmyf3h"}},{"ID":"20240616132553-3yfgpvk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132553-3yfgpvk","updated":"20240616132557"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本经逢原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132553-asenm69","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132553-asenm69","updated":"20240616132553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘咸微温，无毒。酒洗去甲及腐，切片焙用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132553-h76kzm1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132553-h76kzm1","updated":"20240616132553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《本经》主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴益精气，多子，妇人症瘕。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132553-gc2mmcm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132553-gc2mmcm","updated":"20240616132553"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"发明"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉与锁阳，总是一类，味浓性降，命门相火不足者宜之。峻补精血，骤用反动大便滑泄。《本经》主劳伤补中者，是火衰不能生土，非中气之本虚也。治妇人症瘕者，咸能软坚而走血分也。又苁蓉止泄精遗沥，除茎中寒热痛，以其能下导虚火也。锁阳治腰膝软弱，以其能温补精血也。总皆滋益相火之验。老人燥结，宜煮粥食之，但胃气虚者，服之令人呕吐泄泻。强阳易兴而精不固者忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132624-96c8q91","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132624-96c8q91"}},{"ID":"20240616132625-18htua4","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132625-18htua4","updated":"20240616132629"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草备要》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132625-lqz7mrs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132625-lqz7mrs","updated":"20240616132625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"补肾命，滑肠"}]},{"ID":"20240616132625-8misow8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132625-8misow8","updated":"20240616132625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸咸温。入肾经血分。补命门相火，滋润五脏。益髓强筋。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132625-jyumhso","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132625-jyumhso","updated":"20240616132625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"治五劳七伤，绝阳不兴，绝阴不产，腰膝冷痛，崩带遗精，峻补精血（时珍曰∶补而不峻，故有苁蓉之号）。骤用恐妨心，滑大便。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132625-vbnsmee","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132625-vbnsmee","updated":"20240616132625"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"长大如臂，重至斤许。有松子鳞甲者良。酒浸一宿，刷去浮甲，劈破，除内筋膜。酒蒸半日。又酥炙用。忌铁（苏恭曰∶今日所用，多草苁蓉功力稍劣）。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132651-q6czwa8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132651-q6czwa8"}},{"ID":"20240616132652-1fv4msj","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132652-1fv4msj","updated":"20240616132656"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《新修本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132652-4aej9dc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132652-4aej9dc","updated":"20240616132652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，微温，无毒。主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子，疗妇人症瘕，除膀胱邪气、腰痛，止痢。久服轻身。生河西山谷及代郡雁门。五月五日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132652-md7sew9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132652-md7sew9","updated":"20240616132652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代郡雁门属并州，多马处便有，言是野马精落地所生。生时似肉，以作羊肉羹，补虚乏极佳，亦可生啖。芮芮河南间至多。今第一出陇西，形扁广，柔润，多花而味甘。次出北国者，形短而少花。巴东、建平间亦有，而不如也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132652-1xu6x7h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132652-1xu6x7h","updated":"20240616132652"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔谨案〕此注论草苁蓉，陶未见肉者。今人苁蓉，功力殊胜。比来医人，时有用者。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132634-2y1puq5","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132634-2y1puq5"}},{"ID":"20240616132635-sqe81es","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-sqe81es","updated":"20240616132644"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草新编》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-7l7vqbe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-7l7vqbe","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉，味甘温而咸、酸，无毒。入肾。最善兴阳，止崩漏。久用令男女有子，暖腰膝。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-wdh1z22","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-wdh1z22","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"但专补肾中之水火，余无他用。若多用之，能滑大肠。古人所以治虚人大便结者，用苁蓉一两，水洗出盐味，另用净水煮服，即下大便，正取其补虚而滑肠也。然虽补肾，而不可专用，佐人参、白术、熟地、山茱萸诸补阴阳之药，实有利益。使人阳道修伟，与驴鞭同用更奇，但不可用琐阳。盖琐阳非苁蓉可比，苁蓉，乃马精所化，故功性能神；琐阳，非马精所化之物，虽能补阴兴阳，而功效甚薄，故神农薄而不取。近人舍苁蓉，而用琐阳，余所以分辨之也。至于草苁蓉，尤不可用。凡用肉苁蓉，必须拣其肥大而有鳞甲者，始可用。否则，皆草苁蓉而假充之者，买时必宜详察。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-rps5j2c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-rps5j2c","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问肉苁蓉既大补，又性温无毒，多用之正足补肾，何以反动大便？不知肉苁蓉肉，乃马精所化之物，马性最淫，故能兴阳。马精原系肾中所出，故又益阴。然而马性又最动，故骤用之多，易动大便，非其味滑也。（〔批〕近情切理之言。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-kgrnqfj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-kgrnqfj","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问肉苁蓉之动大便，恐是攻剂，而非补药也？夫苁蓉，乃有形之精所生，实补而非泻。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-mzrba9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-mzrba9q","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"试观老人不能大便者，用之以通大便。夫老人之闭结，乃精血之不足，非邪火之有余也，不可以悟其是补而非攻乎。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-fvf6yed","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-fvf6yed","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑肉苁蓉性滑而动大便，凡大肠滑者，可用乎，抑不可用乎？夫大肠滑者，多由于肾中之无火，肉苁蓉兴阳，是补火之物也，补火而独不能坚大肠乎。故骤用之而滑者，久用之而自涩矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-wmu6go6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-wmu6go6","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或疑肉苁蓉，未必是马精所生，此物出之边塞沙土中，岁岁如草之生，安得如许之马精耶？"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-k9cid7c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-k9cid7c","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"曰∶肉苁蓉，是马精所生，非马精所生，吾何由定。但此说，实出于神农之《本草》，非后人之私臆也，肉苁蓉不得马精之气，而生于苦寒边塞之外，又何能兴阳而补水火哉。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132635-tcct7aw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132635-tcct7aw","updated":"20240616132635"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或问王好古曾云∶“服苁蓉以治肾，必妨于心”，何子未识也？曰∶此好古不知苁蓉，而妄诫之也。凡补肾之药，必上通于心，心得肾之精，而后无焦枯之患。苁蓉大补肾之精，即补心之气也，又何妨之有。（〔批〕实是。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132611-ldpv6l2","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132611-ldpv6l2"}},{"ID":"20240616132612-q36v5m2","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-q36v5m2","updated":"20240616132617"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《要药分剂》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-a6spiya","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-a6spiya","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸咸。性温无毒。得天之阳气。地之阴气以生。降也。阳中阴也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-kpjrrgl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-kpjrrgl","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【主治】主五劳七伤。补中。除茎中寒热痛。养五脏。强阴益精气。多子。女人症瘕。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-68zaezk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-68zaezk","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（本经）除膀胱邪气腰痛。止痢。（别录）益髓壮阳。治女人血崩。（甄权）男子绝阳不兴。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-bmnjekt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-bmnjekt","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"女子绝阴不产。润五脏。长肌肉。暖腰膝。男子泄精血遗沥。女子带下阴痛。（大明）【归经】入心包命门二经。为滋肾益精滑肠之品。（兼补剂肾经血分药）【前论】海藏曰。命门相火不足者。以此补之。凡服苁蓉以治肾。必妨心。丹溪曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-e1m61hc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-e1m61hc","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"峻补【禁忌】经疏曰。凡泄泻。肾中有热。强阳易兴而精不固者。均忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132612-w0svinl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132612-w0svinl","updated":"20240616132612"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【炮制】雷公曰。凡使。清酒浸一宿。刷去砂土浮甲。劈破中心。去白膜一重。有此。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132601-qgiedav","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132601-qgiedav"}},{"ID":"20240616132602-5k7vp7q","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132602-5k7vp7q","updated":"20240616132606"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《增广和剂局方药性总论》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132602-xhw60kq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132602-xhw60kq","updated":"20240616132602"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸咸，微温，无毒。主五劳七伤，补中。除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子，妇人症瘕，除膀胱邪气，腰痛，止痢。《药性论》云∶臣。益髓，悦颜色，治女人血崩，壮阳，日御过倍，大补益，主赤白下。补精败，面黑劳伤，用苁蓉四两，水煮令烂，薄切细研精羊肉，分为四度，下五味，以米煮粥，空心服之。日华子云∶治男绝阳不兴，女绝阴不产，润五脏，长肌肉，暖腰膝，男子泄精，尿血，遗沥，带下阴痛。生∶河西雁门。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132529-oz0yamj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132529-oz0yamj"}},{"ID":"20240616132530-gi9ghl0","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-gi9ghl0","updated":"20240616132535"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草述钩元》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-3ihys6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-3ihys6p","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"之颐云。柔红美满。膏释脂凝。肉之体也。濒湖言其性补而不峻。故有从容之名。旧说野马遗沥所生。今西人云。多生大木间。及土堑垣中。乃知自有种类。陇西出者。其形扁。色黄柔润。多花而味甘。余产皆不及。盖是物以极西产者为良。为其得金气之浓也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-o93a1sw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-o93a1sw","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（亦如杞子必取河西之意）味甘酸咸。气微温。肾经血分药也。入心胞络命门肾。相火不足者。以此补之。强阴益精气。益髓补中。主男子绝阳不兴。女子绝阴不产。疗五劳七伤。养五脏。长肌肉。治膀胱邪气腰痛。男子泄精血遗沥。除茎中寒热痛。女子症瘕血崩。带下阴痛。（诸本草）属土而有水与火。峻补精血。骤用反动大便。（丹溪）凡服苁蓉以治肾。必妨心。（海藏）独用数两。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-g4o3hyr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-g4o3hyr","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"浸去咸味。并去鳞甲及中心膜。淡白酒煮烂。顿食。治老人便燥闭结有神。老人虚人汗多便闭。肉苁蓉酒浸焙二两。沉香研末一两。麻子仁汁打糊丸梧子大。每服七八十丸。白汤下。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-wmrjzy7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-wmrjzy7","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"强精健髓。肉苁蓉鳝鱼二味为末。黄精汁丸。服之力可十倍。（干宁记）同牛膝浸酒服。益肾。同人参鹿茸牡狗阴茎白胶杜仲补骨脂。主男子阳痿。老人阳衰。一切肾虚腰痛。兼令人有子。同地黄枸杞牛膝鳖甲天冬麦冬当归白胶杜仲青蒿五味子山萸黄柏。治五劳七伤。茎中寒热痛。妇人症瘕。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-p40v85h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-p40v85h","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔论〕肉苁蓉味甘。气微温。得天之阳气。然更酸咸。得地之阴气。酸咸本甘温以化。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-y900kzv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-y900kzv","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"又缘肺阴下降入心。合于离中之坎以生血。俾清中之浊入于中焦之胃以化血。乃统于脾。纳于肝。归于肾之血海而能化精。）夫气血生化。在中土乃更有金天之专气入心生血以致之。则其气化浓浓。本浊阴之下降而生化愈滋。所以能峻补精血也。顾何以又补命火。缘入心生血者。主于心包络。而包络乃命门相火之源。况肾脉原至于肺。肺气原通于命门乎。但相火原出肾肝。是先天之化源。而后天水谷之精气。本于中土以为化化生生者。却更以心肺为化原。由是观之。其由肺而至心包络。由包络而生命门者。乃气化之权舆。其由胃而脾。由脾而肝肾。乃化血化精之次第。然总由于气化而已。化血化精之次第。何以总归于气化。盖人身上有气海。肺气下降入心。是金合于火以孕水也。火因金而和于水则气化。气之化者生血。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-evw5d1g","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-evw5d1g","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"血从液化而色赤者。水因金而从火也。下有血海。肺气下降归肾。是金亲于水以宅火也。水因金而和于火则气盛。气之盛者生精。精从血化而色白者。火因水而从金也。若是则气之下降归肾者。先由气降入心也。气之下盛化精者。先由气化生血也。（火因金而和于水。则气化生血。水因金而和于火。则气盛化精。盖水火乃气之元。惟金以和之。故肺为气主。总谓之气化。即是化血化精之次第。金气浓而归土。亦归其气之所生也。）大抵苁蓉益阳中之阴。令肾肝阴气自裕。经曰。天气盛则地气不足。谓阳中之阴不足。而阳偏胜也。阳中之阴足。则地气之化裕。而阴中之阳益强。非泛等于补阳之剂。又其功从上而下。不得泛同于益精之品。而止以为入肾也。又脑为髓海。而兹味益髓。夫髓具于肾。何以至于极上之脑而为之海。岂非阴统于阳。而精盈则气盛。遂俾阴中之阳。更还于至阳之地乎。所谓总根于气化者。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-kvvs7rn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-kvvs7rn","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"始之终之。皆不能越矣。用益肾阳。世概与骨脂例视。讵知骨脂由归阳以化精髓。从阳化阴。苁蓉则由精血之益以归阳。从阴生阳也。从阴生阳。洵当补而不峻矣。缪氏云。泄泻禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-z9deez4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-z9deez4","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阳强易兴而精不固者忌。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-e66bsdl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-e66bsdl","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"〔修治〕酒浸一宿。刷去浮甲。劈破。去中心白膜。如竹丝草样。不尔令人上气不散。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132530-ivb9mdr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132530-ivb9mdr","updated":"20240616132530"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"再用酒洗。浸透切片。仍酒拌蒸之。从午至酉。取出焙干用。忌铁器。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132455-56oqr9o","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132455-56oqr9o"}},{"ID":"20240616132456-ngrokdt","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-ngrokdt","updated":"20240616132500"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《中药炮制》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-z8ixytk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-z8ixytk","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『来源』本品为列当科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"的干燥带鳞片的肉质茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-2p5saek","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-2p5saek","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『常用名』淡大云、大云、盐大云。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-p9uvn1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-p9uvn1b","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『产地』内蒙、宁夏、甘肃等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-j131g1b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-j131g1b","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『采收季节』春秋季采收。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-sbuvrth","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-sbuvrth","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『炮制方法』①取盐大云，放入清水中，洗去沙土，放缸内再加清水漂七天，春秋季每天换水1次，冬季每两天换水1次，夏季每天换水2次，以无咸味为止。取出滤干水分，切1分厚横片，晒干。②取淡大云，无盐霜，用清水漂2～3天，捞入蒸笼内，蒸2小时，取出，凉至八成干，放缸内润透切片晒干。③甜大云，洗去泥沙投入缸中用清水漂至1～3天，每天换水1次，夏天换水两次，漂两天后，取出用小刀刮去鳞片后再放缸内漂1天，到时取出，凉至八成干，再放到缸内，润透取出切横片1分厚，晒干。为避免肉苁蓉滑肠致泻，增强温肾助阳之功，每斤药用黄酒3两，拌入药片内，润片刻，放蒸笼内蒸2小时取出，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-9j5566k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-9j5566k","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『用量』6～12克。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132456-286i4lf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132456-286i4lf","updated":"20240616132456"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"『贮存』装缸内加盖、防潮。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132426-scg6bgq","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132426-scg6bgq"}},{"ID":"20240616132427-8w9vdzx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132427-8w9vdzx","updated":"20240616132431"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草衍义》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132427-kjaarqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132427-kjaarqo","updated":"20240616132427"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《图经》以谓“皮如松，子有鳞”。子字当为壳，于义为允。又曰∶“以酒净洗，去黑汁作羹”。黑汁既去，气味皆尽。然嫩者方可作羹，老者苦。入药，少则不效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132407-wlhgqhw","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132407-wlhgqhw"}},{"ID":"20240616132408-uan5m1c","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132408-uan5m1c","updated":"20240616132412"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草经集注》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132408-zmgfrep","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132408-zmgfrep","updated":"20240616132408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，微温，无毒。主治五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132408-s4c0v17","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132408-s4c0v17","updated":"20240616132408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"益精气，多子，治妇人症瘕，除膀胱邪气、腰痛，止痢。久服轻身。生河西山谷及代郡雁门。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132408-nabdn5p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132408-nabdn5p","updated":"20240616132408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"五月五日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132408-pehtnap","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132408-pehtnap","updated":"20240616132408"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"代郡雁门属并州，多马处便有，言是野马精落地所生。生时似肉，以作羊肉羹，补虚乏极佳，亦可生啖。芮芮河南间至多。今第一出陇西，形扁广，柔润，多花而味甘。次出北国者，形短而少花。巴东、建平间亦有，而不如也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132355-1hby59z","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132355-1hby59z"}},{"ID":"20240616132356-zjj9hqa","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-zjj9hqa","updated":"20240616132401"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《证类本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-s560qad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-s560qad","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、酸、咸，微温，无毒。主五劳七伤，补中。除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子，妇人症瘕，除膀胱邪气，腰痛，止痢。久服轻身。生河西山谷及代郡雁门。五月五日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-ruw7ugc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-ruw7ugc","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陶隐居云∶代郡雁门属并州，多马处便有，言是野马精落地所生。生时似肉，以作羊肉羹，补虚乏极佳，亦可生啖。芮芮河南间至多。今第一出陇西，形扁广，柔润，多花而味甘。次出北国者，形短而少花。巴东建平间亦有，而不如也。唐本注云∶此注论草苁蓉，陶未见肉者。今人所用亦草苁蓉，刮去花用代肉尔。《本经》有肉苁蓉，功力殊胜。比来医人，时有用者。臣禹锡等谨按蜀本图经云∶出肃州禄福县沙中，三月、四月掘根，切取中央好者三四寸，绳穿阴干。八月始好，皮如松子鳞甲，根长尺余。其草苁蓉，四月中旬采，长五、六寸至一尺以来，茎圆紫色，采取压令扁，日干。原州、秦州、灵州皆有之。吴氏云∶肉苁蓉，一名肉松蓉。神农、黄帝∶咸。雷公∶酸。季氏∶小温。生河西山阴地，长三、四寸，丛生。或代郡，二月至八月采。药性论云∶肉苁蓉，臣。益髓，悦颜色，延年，治女人血崩，壮阳，日御过倍大补益。主赤白下，补精败，面黑，劳伤。用苁蓉四两，水煮令烂。薄切细研，精羊肉分为四度，五味，以米煮粥，空心服之。日华子云∶治男绝阳不兴，女绝阴不产，润五脏，长肌肉，暖腰膝，男子泄精，尿血，遗沥，带下，阴痛。据本草云∶即是野马精余沥结成。采访人方知 落树下并土堑上，此即非马交之处，陶说误耳。又有花苁蓉，即是春抽苗者，力较微耳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-yz182f9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-yz182f9","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"图经曰∶肉苁蓉，生河西山谷及代郡雁门，今陕西州郡多有之，然不及西羌界中来者，肉浓而力紧。旧说是野马遗沥落地所生。今西人云大木间及土堑垣中多生此，非游牝之所而乃有，则知自有种类耳。或凝其初生于马沥，后乃滋殖。如茜根生于人血之类是也。皮如松子，有鳞甲．苗下有一细扁根，长尺余，三月采根，采时掘取中央好者，以绳穿，阴干。至八月乃堪用。《本经》云∶五月五日采。五月恐已老不堪，故多三月采之。西人多用作食品啖之，刮去鳞甲，以酒净洗，去黑汁，薄切，合山芋、羊肉作羹，极美好益人，食之胜服补药。又有一种草苁蓉，极相类，但根短，茎圆，紫色。比来人多取，刮去花，压令扁，以代肉者，功力殊劣耳。又下品有列当条云∶生山南岩石上，如藕根，初生掘取，阴干，亦名草苁蓉。性温，补男子。疑即是此物。今人鲜用，故少有辨之者，因附见于此。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-duxm7vm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-duxm7vm","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"陈藏器序云∶强筋健髓，苁蓉、鳝鱼为末，黄精酒丸服之，力可十倍。此说出《干宁记》。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-jqdp4kz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-jqdp4kz","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使，先须用清酒浸一宿，至明，以棕刷刷去沙土浮甲尽，劈破中心，去白膜一重，如竹丝草样。是此偏隔人心前气不散，令人上气不出。凡使用，先须酒浸，并刷草了，却蒸，从午至酉，出，又用酥炙得所。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132356-mmiid31","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132356-mmiid31","updated":"20240616132356"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"衍义曰∶肉苁蓉，《图经》以谓皮如松子，有鳞。子字当为壳。于义为允。又曰∶以酒净洗，去黑汁作羹。黑汁既去，气味皆尽。然嫩者方可作羹，老者苦。入药，少则不效。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132030-ouv39i7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132030-ouv39i7"}},{"ID":"20240616132344-etosreu","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132344-etosreu","updated":"20240616132350"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《玉楸药解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132344-ffpwk9e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132344-ffpwk9e","updated":"20240616132344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘、咸，气平，入足厥阴肝、足少阴肾、手阳明大肠经。暖腰膝，健筋骨，滋肾肝精血，润肠胃结燥。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132344-gmy0y6f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132344-gmy0y6f","updated":"20240616132344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"凡粪粒坚小，形如羊屎，此土湿木郁，下窍闭塞之故。谷滓在胃，不得顺下，零星传送，断落不联，历阳明大肠之燥，炼成颗粒，秘涩难通。总缘风木枯槁，疏泄不行也，一服地黄、龟胶，反益土湿，中气愈败矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132344-ofom574","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132344-ofom574","updated":"20240616132344"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉滋木清风，养血润燥，善滑大肠而下结粪。其性从容不迫，未至滋湿败脾，非诸润药可比。方书称其补精益髓，悦色延年，理男子绝阳不兴，女子绝阴不产，非溢美之词。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132307-3n27ap7","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132307-3n27ap7"}},{"ID":"20240616132330-tr8h32z","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132330-tr8h32z","updated":"20240616132335"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《雷公炮制药性解》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132330-twajkjp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132330-twajkjp","updated":"20240616132330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸咸，性微温无毒，入命门经。兴阳道，益精髓，补劳伤，强筋骨，主男子精泄尿血，溺有遗沥，女子症痛崩带，宫寒不孕，酒浸一宿，去浮甲，劈破中心，去白膜，蒸半日，酥炙用。润而肥大者佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132330-bonfab7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132330-bonfab7","updated":"20240616132330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"按∶苁蓉性温，为浊中之浊，故入命门而补火，惟尺脉弱者宜之，相火旺者忌用，多服令人大便滑。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132330-uewipbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132330-uewipbk","updated":"20240616132330"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"雷公云∶凡使先须清酒浸一宿，至明，以板刷去上沙土浮甲尽，劈破中心，去白膜一重，如竹丝草样，是此偏隔人心，前气不散，令人上气不出。凡使先用酒浸并刷净，去蒸，从午至酉出，又用酥炙佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132307-krfa1v8","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132307-krfa1v8"}},{"ID":"20240616132319-bpktudx","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-bpktudx","updated":"20240616132324"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草崇原》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132319-mv40w6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-mv40w6a","updated":"20240616132319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"气味甘，微温，无毒。主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子，妇人症瘕。久服轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132319-f72h4ro","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-f72h4ro","updated":"20240616132319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（肉苁蓉《吴氏本草》名松容，又名黑司命。始出河西山谷及代州雁门，今以陇西者为胜，北国者次之，乃野马之精入于土中而生。陇西者形扁色黄，柔润多花，其味甘。北国者形短少花，生时似肉，三四月掘根，长尺余，绳穿阴干，八月始好皮，有松子鳞甲，故名松容。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132319-ns1vpwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-ns1vpwi","updated":"20240616132319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马属午畜，以少阴为正化，子水为对化，故名黑司命。朱丹溪曰∶肉苁蓉罕得，多以金莲根用盐制而伪充，或以草苁蓉代之，用者宜审。苏恭曰∶草苁蓉功用稍劣。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132319-5m5yn4z","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-5m5yn4z","updated":"20240616132319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"马为火畜，精属水阴，苁蓉感马精而生，其形似肉，气味甘温，盖禀少阴水火之气，而归于太阴坤土之药也。土性柔和，故有苁蓉之名。五劳者，志劳、思劳、烦劳、忧劳、恚劳也。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132319-lkmky5d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132319-lkmky5d","updated":"20240616132319"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"七伤者，喜、怒、忧、悲、思、恐、惊，七情所伤也。水火阴阳之气，会归中土，则五劳七伤可治矣。得太阴坤土之精，故补中。得少阴水火之气，故除茎中寒热痛。阴阳水火之气，归于太阴坤土之中，故养五脏。强阴者，火气盛也。益精者，水气盛也。多子者，水火阴阳皆盛也。妇人症瘕，乃血精留聚于郛郭之中，土气盛，则症瘕自消。而久服轻身。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132308-zrxib1v","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132308-zrxib1v"}},{"ID":"20240616132309-33o13dy","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132309-33o13dy","updated":"20240616132313"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《千金翼方》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132309-jv7gfp9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132309-jv7gfp9","updated":"20240616132309"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘酸咸，微温，无毒。主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，多子。疗妇人症瘕，除膀胱邪气，腰痛，止痢。久服轻身。生河西山谷及代郡雁门，五月五日采，阴干。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132219-gpnlmd3","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132219-gpnlmd3"}},{"ID":"20240616132259-omy5tmr","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132259-omy5tmr","updated":"20240616132303"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草从新》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132259-d1374uh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132259-d1374uh","updated":"20240616132259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"补肾命门、滑肠．"}]},{"ID":"20240616132259-ptp8d0w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132259-ptp8d0w","updated":"20240616132259"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"甘酸咸温．入肾经血分．补命门相火．滋润五脏．益髓强筋．治五劳七伤．绝阳不兴．绝阴不产．腰膝冷痛．峻补精血．（时珍曰∶补而不峻、故有苁蓉之号．）骤用恐妨心．滑大便．功用与琐阳相仿．禁忌亦同．长大如臂．重至斤许．有松子鳞甲者良．酒浸一宿．刷去浮甲．劈破．除内筋膜．酒蒸半日．又酥炙用．忌铁．（苏恭注唐本草曰∶今人所用、多草苁蓉、功力稍劣．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132219-htkwwub","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132219-htkwwub"}},{"ID":"20240616132246-khxs9np","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-khxs9np","updated":"20240616132254"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《神农本草经赞》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132246-mrpe6rf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-mrpe6rf","updated":"20240616132246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味甘微温。主五劳七伤。补中除茎中寒热痛。养五脏。强阴益精气。多子。妇人症瘕。久服轻身。生山谷。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132246-j2du7me","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-j2du7me","updated":"20240616132246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"阴阳司命。福禄丛生。名假肉食。体遍鳞纹。妄言马沥。杂啖羊羹。苁蓉中道。补益功成。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132246-1r7ze9w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-1r7ze9w","updated":"20240616132246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"日华子曰。治男子绝阳。女子绝阴。吴普曰。一名黑司命。韩保升曰。出肃州福禄县沙中。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132246-weclc4l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-weclc4l","updated":"20240616132246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"左传。肉食者鄙。南史纪。齐高帝鳞纹遍其体。苏颂曰。旧说是野马遗沥所生。陶弘景曰。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132246-71ugeqe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132246-71ugeqe","updated":"20240616132246"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以作羊羹补虚乏。李时珍曰。补而不峻。故有苁蓉之号。中庸。苁蓉中道。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132219-rfyf7pr","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132219-rfyf7pr"}},{"ID":"20240616132232-8ekfado","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132232-8ekfado","updated":"20240616132241"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草图经》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132232-9h9q4qz","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132232-9h9q4qz","updated":"20240616132234"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"em","TextMarkTextContent":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"，生河西山谷及代郡雁门，今陕西州郡多有之，然不及西羌界中来者，肉浓而力紧。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132232-5wijdsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132232-5wijdsi","updated":"20240616132232"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"旧说是野马遗沥落地所生。今西人云大木间及土堑垣中多生，此非游牝之所而乃有，则知自有种类耳。或疑其初生于马沥，后乃滋殖，如茜根生于人血之类是也。皮如松子有鳞甲，苗下有一细扁根，长尺余。三月采根，采时掘取中央好者，以绳穿，阴干。至八月乃堪用。《本经》云∶五月五日采。五月恐已老不堪，故多三月采之。西人多用作食品啖之。刮去鳞甲，以酒净洗去黑汁，薄切，合山芋、羊肉作羹，极美好，益人，食之胜服补药。又有一种草苁蓉，极相类，但根短，茎圆，紫色。比来人多取，刮去花，压令扁，以代肉者，功力殊劣耳。又下品有列当条，云生山南岩石上，如藕根，初生掘取，阴干，亦名草苁蓉。性温，补男子，疑即是此物。今人鲜用，故少有辨之者，因附见于此。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132219-c9dv29x","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132219-c9dv29x"}},{"ID":"20240616132220-sk7t5cm","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132220-sk7t5cm","updated":"20240616132225"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《得配本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132220-7tduli2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132220-7tduli2","updated":"20240616132220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"忌铜、铁。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132220-7kze29h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132220-7kze29h","updated":"20240616132220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"味咸，性温。入命门，兼入足少阴经血分。壮阳强阴。除茎中虚痛，腰膝寒疼，阴冷不孕。同鳝鱼为末，黄精汁为丸服之，力增十倍。得山萸肉、北五味，治善食中消。得沉香，治汗多虚秘。合菟丝子，治尿血泄精。佐精羊肉，治精败面黑。（肾中无火精亦败）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132220-hck9yjy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132220-hck9yjy","updated":"20240616132220"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"酒浸，刷去浮甲，劈破中心，去肉筋膜如竹丝草样者。有此能隔人心前气不散，令人上气也。漂极淡，蒸半日用，以酥炙用亦可。润大便不须炙。大便滑，精不固，火盛便秘，阳道易举，心虚气胀，皆禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132030-gqvl2va","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132030-gqvl2va"}},{"ID":"20240616132159-g3jvwbl","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132159-g3jvwbl","updated":"20240616132208"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草便读》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132159-4z0m2y2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132159-4z0m2y2","updated":"20240616132159"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"壮阳滋肾．甘咸少带微酸．补命通幽．温润且犹兼黑．锁阳之性．主治相同．（肉苁蓉草类也．其状柔软如肉．形有鳞甲如松枝．一云马精遗地而生者．亦未知然否．甘咸温润色黑．专入肝肾．能益精壮阳．但无峻补之力．却有滑肠之能．故虽肝肾不足．而脾虚便溏者．不宜服之．锁阳亦一类二种耳．锁阳出处形质性味功用．皆与苁蓉同．为肾经血分药．能补下焦阳中之阴．与巴戟之补阴中之阳者略异．故凡老人阳中之阴不足．而致大便结燥者宜之．）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132030-e7b9uoj","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132030-e7b9uoj"}},{"ID":"20240616132150-rkppt9h","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132150-rkppt9h","updated":"20240616132153"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《本草求真》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132150-06y31pj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132150-06y31pj","updated":"20240616132150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（山草）滋肾润燥"}]},{"ID":"20240616132150-81wxdln","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132150-81wxdln","updated":"20240616132150"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉（专入肾。兼入大肠）。甘酸咸温。体润色黑。诸书既言峻补精血。又言力能兴阳助火。是明因其气温。力专滋阴。得此阳随阴附而阳自见兴耳！惟其力能滋补。故凡症瘕积块。得此而坚即消。惟其滋补而阳得助。故凡遗精茎痛。寒热时作。亦得因是而除。若谓火衰至极。用此甘润之品。同于附桂。力能补阳。其失远矣！况此既言补阴。而补阴又以苁蓉为名。是明因其功力不骤。气专润燥。是亦宜于便闭。而不宜于胃虚之人也。谓之滋阴则可。谓之正未必。然长大如臂。重至斤许。有松子鳞甲者良。酒浸。刷去浮甲。劈。除内筋膜。酒蒸半日。酥炙用。忌铁器。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132727-l1zzfoo","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240616132727-l1zzfoo"}},{"ID":"20240616132728-oif8hki","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-oif8hki","updated":"20240616132732"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉苁蓉《中药学》"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-j7zjlvr","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-j7zjlvr","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【科属与药用部分】本品为列当科植物肉从蓉的肉质茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-f30il12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-f30il12","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【性味与归经】甘、咸，温。入肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-98jnzbo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-98jnzbo","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【功效】补肾助阳，润肠通便。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-d65f94f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-d65f94f","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【临床应用】1.用于肾虚阳痿，遗精早泄及腰膝冷痛，筋骨痉弱等症。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-6s8u7ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-6s8u7ca","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"肉从蓉温而不燥，补而不峻，用于肾虚阳痿、遗精、早泄等症，可配合熟地黄、菟丝子、山萸肉等同用；治腰膝冷痛、筋骨痿弱，可配合续断、补骨脂等同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-gv3zif8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-gv3zif8","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.用于肠燥便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-8jv8xfm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-8jv8xfm","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品能温润滑肠，多用于老年人及病后、产后津液不足，肠燥便秘之症，常与火麻仁.柏子仁等药配伍同用。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-d7lgtpa","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-d7lgtpa","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【处方用名】甜苁蓉、甜大云、肉苁蓉（切片用。）"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-ee1cl6m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-ee1cl6m","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【一般用量与用法】三钱至五钱，煎服。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-xcx43zx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-xcx43zx","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【按语】1.肉从蓉性温而柔润，功能补肾助阳，与巴戟天相似，都可用于下元虚冷的症候，且常配合同用。但巴戟天散风袪寒湿，可用于下肢寒湿痹痛；而肉苁蓉则滋液而润燥，可用治津液不足的肠燥便秘。从以上两药功用不同之处，可以看出肉苁蓉的性质较巴戟天更为柔润，是一味补阳益阴的药物。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-uh8dvgj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-uh8dvgj","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.本品过去因炮制方法不同，有甜苁蓉、咸苁蓉、淡苁蓉的区别，现在上海地区对从蓉的炮制方法，已简化而不再区分。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-7ba7qws","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-7ba7qws","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【方剂举例】肉苁蓉丸《证治准绳》：肉苁蓉、熟地黄、淮山药、五味子、菟丝子。治肾虚小便频数。"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-mfun8wy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-mfun8wy","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【文献摘录】《本经》：「主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气‥…妇人症瘕。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-40m22vg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-40m22vg","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《药性本草》：「益髓‥…大补壮阳‥…治女人血崩。」"}]},{"ID":"20240616132728-84niqx7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240616132728-84niqx7","updated":"20240616132728"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《汤液本草》：「肾经血分药也。」"}]},{"ID":"20240607123148-pmr9qui","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607123148-pmr9qui"}},{"ID":"20240607123235-0mzf833","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-0mzf833","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中国药典》：肉苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-wnfvn0l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-wnfvn0l","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-uhgwkks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-uhgwkks","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ròu Cōnɡ Rónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-55a1tlm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-55a1tlm","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-f7udzxv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-f7udzxv","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" HERBA CISTANCHES"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-u2agbjm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-u2agbjm","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-dyqpk15","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-dyqpk15","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品为列当科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"Cistanche deserticola Y.C.Ma的干燥"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"带鳞叶的肉质茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。多于春季苗未出土或刚出土时采挖，除去花序，切段，晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-6aiugq6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-6aiugq6","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-akoshmy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-akoshmy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 本品呈扁圆柱形，稍弯曲，长3～15cm,直径2～8cm。表面棕褐色或灰棕色，密被覆瓦状排列的肉质鳞叶，通常鳞叶先端已断，体重，质硬，微有柔性，不易折断，断面棕褐色，有淡棕色点状维管束，排列成波状环纹。气微，味甜、微苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-229qwjw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-229qwjw","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"贮藏"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-xvnj0ca","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-xvnj0ca","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 置通风干燥处，防蛀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-6x2x0y3","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-6x2x0y3","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-i2oos46","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-i2oos46","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" "},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉苁蓉片"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"： 除去杂质，洗净，润透，切厚片，干燥。本品为不规则形切片，厚约3mm。表面棕褐色或灰棕色。有的可见肉质鳞叶。切面黄棕色、灰棕色或棕褐色，有淡棕色或棕黄色点状维管束，排列成不规则的波状环纹，或排成条状而散列。气微，味甜、微苦。取本品1.5g，照上述[鉴别]（1）、（2）、（3）项试验，应显相同的结果。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-54lkiab","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-54lkiab","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"酒苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"： 取净肉苁蓉片，照酒炖或酒蒸法（附录Ⅱ D）炖或蒸至酒吸尽。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-m5n4l9h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-m5n4l9h","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-h4j2p9c","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-h4j2p9c","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" （1）取本品粉末1g，加含0.5％ 盐酸的乙醇溶液8ml，加热回流10分钟，趁热滤过，滤液加氨试液调节至中性，蒸干，残渣加1％ 盐酸溶液3ml 使溶解，滤过。取滤液1ml,加碘化铋钾试液1～2滴，生成橘红色或红棕色沉淀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-w3x9ltf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-w3x9ltf","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（2）取本品粉末1g，加甲醇10ml，超声处理10分钟，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取麦角甾苷对照品，加甲醇制成每1ml含2.5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述两种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一硅胶G薄层板上，以醋酸乙酯-甲醇-9％醋酸溶液（20:3:2）为展开剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以5％三氯化铁乙醇溶液。供试品色谱中，在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-m7gzd9v","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-m7gzd9v","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"（3） 取本品粉末1g，加80％乙醇10ml，加热回流10分钟，滤过，滤液作为供试品溶液。另取肉苁蓉对照药材1g，同法制成对照药材溶液。再取甜菜碱对照品，加80％乙醇制成每1ml含5mg的溶液，作为对照品溶液。照薄层色谱法（附录Ⅵ B）试验，吸取上述三种溶液各5μl，分别点于同一以羧甲基纤维素钠为黏合剂的硅胶G薄层板上，以甲醇-水-醋酸（9:2:0.5）为展开"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-r6v6ggs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-r6v6ggs","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"剂，展开，取出，晾干，喷以改良碘化铋钾试液。供试品色谱中，在与对照药材色谱相应的位置上，显相同颜色的斑点；在与对照品色谱相应的位置上，显相同的橙红色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-aziaogu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-aziaogu","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"含量测定"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-71wupqo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-71wupqo","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 照高效液相色谱法（附录Ⅵ D）测定。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-qk2zx2w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-qk2zx2w","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"色谱条件与系统适用性试验 用十八烷基硅烷键合硅胶为填充剂；乙腈-甲醇-1％醋酸溶液（10:15:75）为流动相；检测波长为334nm。理论板数按麦角甾苷峰计算应不低于3000。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-d2rmq6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-d2rmq6n","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"对照品溶液的制备 精密称取麦角甾苷对照品4mg，置25ml棕色量瓶中，加流动相至刻度，摇匀，即得（每1ml中含麦角甾苷160μg）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-4qggbpy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-4qggbpy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"供试品溶液的制备 取本品粉末（过四号筛）约1g[同时另取本品粉末测定水分（附录Ⅸ H第一法）]，精密称定，置100ml棕色量瓶中，精密加甲醇 50ml，密塞，摇匀，称定重量，浸泡0.5小时，超声处理（功率250W，频率40kHz）40分钟（50℃以下），取出，放冷，再称定重量，用甲醇补足减失的重量，摇匀，离心，取上清液用微孔滤膜（0.45μm）滤过，滤液置棕色量瓶中，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-mwwfpaw","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-mwwfpaw","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"测定法 分别精密吸取对照品溶液5μl与供试品溶液5～10μl，注入液相色谱仪，测定，即得。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-o9ycooi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-o9ycooi","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"本品按干燥品计算，含麦角甾苷（C29H36O15）不得少于0.080％。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8cy1efe","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8cy1efe","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-pacgl12","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-pacgl12","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-uzxobbk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-uzxobbk","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-nsf3suy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-nsf3suy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘、咸，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-97damty","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-97damty","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-upwepxq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-upwepxq","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾阳，益精血，润肠通便。用于阳痿，不孕，腰膝酸软，筋骨无力，肠燥便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-pm5x4lb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-pm5x4lb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jqnunz4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jqnunz4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 6～9g。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-efcnddo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-efcnddo","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-poswz3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-poswz3h","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中国药典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jr2ysa8","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jr2ysa8","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中药大辞典》：肉苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-y3xnob4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-y3xnob4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-vw9z7ld","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-vw9z7ld","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ròu Cōnɡ Rónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-krv619d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-krv619d","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-vrisy3h","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-vrisy3h","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉松蓉（《吴普本草》），纵蓉（《本草经集注》），地精（《石药尔雅》），金笋（《现代实用中药》），大芸（《青海药材》）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-zw5sxx4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-zw5sxx4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-j69uswn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-j69uswn","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《本经》"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-fk0au1q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-fk0au1q","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-teztv5o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-teztv5o","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 为列当科植物"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"或"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"苁蓉、迷肉苁蓉"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"等的"},{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"肉质茎"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"。春、秋均可采收。但以3～5月间采者为好，过时则中空。春季采者，通常半埋于沙土中晒干，商品称为\"甜大芸\"、\"淡大芸\"或\"淡苁蓉\"。秋采者，因水分多，不易晒干，须投入盐湖中1～3年后，取出晒干，称为\"盐大芸\"、\"咸大芸\"或\"咸苁蓉\"。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-66v3jve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-66v3jve","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8xrufyi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8xrufyi","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①肉苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-vhx4jp4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-vhx4jp4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生寄生草本，高15～40厘米。茎肉质肥厚，圆柱形，黄色，不分枝或有时从基部分2～3枝。被多数肉质鳞片状叶，黄色至褐黄色，覆瓦状排列，卵形至长圆状披针形，长1～2.5厘米，宽4～8毫米，在茎下部者较短且排列较紧密，上部者较长，排列较疏松。穗状花序圆柱形，长8～25厘米；宽6～8厘米，花多数而密集；每花的基部有1枚火苞片和2枚对称的小苞片，大苞片卵形或长圆状披针形，先端尖，小苞片长圆状披针形，与花萼几等长；花萼钟形，淡黄色或白色，长1～1.3厘米，5浅裂，裂片近圆形，无毛或多少被有绵毛；花冠管状钟形，5浅裂，裂片近圆形，紫色，管部白色；雄蕊4，花药倒卵圆形，先端有短尖的药隔，花药与花丝基部被皱曲的长柔毛；子房上位，长椭圆形，花柱细长。蒴果椭圆形，2裂。种子多数。花期5～6月。果期6～7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-qcalmbx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-qcalmbx","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于盐碱地、干河沟沙地、戈壁滩一带。寄生在红沙、盐爪爪、着叶盐爪、珍珠、西伯利亚白刺等植物的根上。分布内蒙古、陕西、甘肃、宁夏、新疆等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-2ovohj1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-2ovohj1","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-e8jqj9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-e8jqj9o","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生寄生草本，高可达1米。形与肉苁蓉相似，但茎上鳞片状叶呈披针形或线状披针形，长1.5～4厘米，宽4～8毫米，先端渐尖。花黄色，大苞片线状披针形，近于光滑，小苞片披针形或线状披针形，稍长于花萼；花萼光滑无毛，裂片边缘有细圆齿。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-702gcgx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-702gcgx","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于湖边、沙地、琐琐林中，寄生在琐琐的根上。分布内蒙古等地。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-yzh85op","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-yzh85op","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③迷肉苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-fxh3461","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-fxh3461","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"多年生寄生草本。茎基部特别肥厚，直径30～45厘米，鳞片状叶；呈卵状披针形；茎中部较细，直径15～25厘米，鳞片状叶呈长团状披针形。穗状花序长圆形或圆柱形；苞片边缘密被绵毛；花冠裂片边缘具细毛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-2tjuyh7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-2tjuyh7","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生于沙地、琐琐林中，寄生在琐琐根上。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-zt97pmo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-zt97pmo","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"分布内蒙古等地"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-v30ovhs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-v30ovhs","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-ri95f1o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-ri95f1o","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①甜苁蓉呈圆柱状而稍扁，一端略细，稍弯曲，长10～30厘米，直径2～6厘米。表面灰棕色或褐色，密被肥厚的肉质鳞片，呈覆瓦状排列。质坚实，微有韧性，肉质而带油性，不易折断，断面棕色，有花白点或裂隙。气微弱，味微甜。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-sub2j6l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-sub2j6l","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②盐苁蓉形状较不整齐，黑褐色，质较软，外面带有盐霜。断面黑色，气微，味咸。以上均以肉质、条粗长、棕褐色、柔嫩滋润者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-cz7o2jd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-cz7o2jd","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"产于内蒙古、甘肃、新疆、青海等地。以内蒙古产量最大。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-h517t8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-h517t8f","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-zp2dfy2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-zp2dfy2","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉苁蓉含有微量生物碱及结品性中性物质。迷肉苁蓉含有生物碱。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jejyo8j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jejyo8j","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-23obiiy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-23obiiy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉苁蓉稀酒精浸出物加入饮水中饲养幼大鼠，其体重增长较对照组快。水浸剂、乙醇-水浸出液和乙醇浸出液试验于狗、猫及兔等麻醉动物，证明有降血压作用。肉苁蓉对小鼠有促进唾液分泌及呼吸麻痹作用，促进唾液分泌的成分为某种有机酸样物质，呼吸麻痹的成分可能力甙类。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8rki2qx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8rki2qx","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-7pp9ypt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-7pp9ypt","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉苁蓉：拣净杂质，清水浸泡，每天换水1～2次（如系咸苁蓉，泡尽盐分），润透，切片（纵切），晒干。酒苁蓉：取苁蓉片，用黄酒拌匀，置罐内密闭，坐水锅中，隔水加热蒸至酒尽为度，取出，晾干。（每肉苁蓉100斤，用黄酒30斤）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-uaxd3ym","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-uaxd3ym","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《雷公炮炙论》：\"凡使（肉苁蓉），先须用清酒浸一宿，至明，以棕刷刷去沙土浮甲尽，劈破中心，去白膜一重如竹丝草样，却蒸，从午至酉出，又用酥炙得所。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-7ux1d36","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-7ux1d36","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1o2otcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1o2otcb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 入肾、大肠经。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-5b9bhvi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-5b9bhvi","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草经疏》：\"入肾、心包络、命门。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-c4m4wlg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-c4m4wlg","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经解》：\"入足厥阴肝经、足太阴脾经、足少阴肾经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8zxux7y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8zxux7y","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《玉楸药解》：\"入足厥阴肝、足少阴肾、手阳明大肠经。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-6re8bds","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-6re8bds","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-iarm509","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-iarm509","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 甘酸咸，温。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-iehrgxt","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-iehrgxt","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"味甘，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-77moh1j","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-77moh1j","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"酸咸，无毒。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-9qgmuxf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-9qgmuxf","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《本草正》：\"味甘咸微辛酸，微温。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-bgap1zg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-bgap1zg","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《玉楸药解》：\"甘咸，气平。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-y3cts5u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-y3cts5u","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-do1jlsi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-do1jlsi","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃弱便溏，相火旺者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-fbt4c6k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-fbt4c6k","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本草蒙筌》：\"忌经铁器。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-dsu55h5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-dsu55h5","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《本草经疏》：\"泄泻禁用，肾中有热，强阳易兴而精不固者忌之。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-gf4zhh2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-gf4zhh2","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药品化义》：\"相火旺，胃肠弱者忌用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-198we9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-198we9y","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《得配本草》；\"忌铜、铁。火盛便闭、心虚气胀，皆禁用。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8aboa6a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8aboa6a","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-rtarlwi","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-rtarlwi","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾，益精，润燥，滑肠。治男子阳痿，女子不孕，带下，血崩，腰膝冷痛，血枯便秘。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-ml7nqwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-ml7nqwh","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"①《本经》：\"主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，妇人症瘕。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-vhpuwdb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-vhpuwdb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②《别录》：\"除膀胱邪气，腰痛，止痢。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-n9pf83p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-n9pf83p","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③《药性论》：\"益髓，悦颜色，延年，治女人血崩，壮阳，大补益，主亦白下。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1uag2kk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1uag2kk","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④《日华子本草》：\"治男绝阳不兴，女绝阴不产，润五脏，长肌肉，暖腰膝，男子泄精，尿血，遗沥，带下阴痛。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-o7ls52u","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-o7ls52u","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤《本草经疏》：\"白酒煮烂顿食，治老人便燥闭结。\""}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-y37cr9y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-y37cr9y","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-w4zcw9q","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-w4zcw9q","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，2～3钱；或入丸剂。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-ip9ludn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-ip9ludn","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-odwolme","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-odwolme","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" ①治男子五劳七伤，阴痿不起，积有十年，痒湿，小便淋沥，溺时赤时黄：肉苁蓉、菟丝子、蛇床子、五味子、远志、续断、杜仲各四分。上七物，捣筛，蜜和为丸如梧子.平旦服五丸，日再。（《医心方》肉苁蓉丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-91o0jp1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-91o0jp1","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"②治下部虚损，腹内疼痛，不喜饮食，平补：肉苁蓉二斤，酒浸三日，细切，焙干，捣罗为末，分一半，醇酒煮作膏，和一半入臼中，捣丸如梧桐子大。每服二十丸，加至三十丸，温酒或米饮下，空心食前。（《圣济总录》肉苁蓉丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-recf24a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-recf24a","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"③补精败，面黑劳伤：苁蓉四两（水煮令烂，薄切细研），精羊肉，分为四度，下五味，以米煮粥，空心服之。（《药性论》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-64i5k3o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-64i5k3o","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"④强筋健髓：苁蓉、蝉鱼。为末，黄精酒丸服之。（《本草拾遗》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-5nxscsl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-5nxscsl","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑤治虚损，暖下元，益精髓，利腰膝：肉苁蓉（酒浸一宿，刮去皱皮，炙干）、蛇床子、远志（去心）、五味子、防风（去芦头）、附子（炮裂，去皮、脐）、菟丝子（酒浸三日，曝干，别捣为末）、巴戟、杜仲（去粗皮，炙微黄，锉）各一两。上药捣罗为末，炼蜜和丸如梧桐子大。每日空心，以温酒下二十丸，盐汤下亦得，渐加至四十丸为度。（《圣惠方》肉苁蓉丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-v0zhp4p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-v0zhp4p","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑥治肾虚白浊：肉苁蓉、鹿茸、山药、白茯苓等分。为末，米糊丸梧子大。枣汤每下三十丸。（《圣济总录》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-bfqegad","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-bfqegad","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑦治发汗利小便亡津液，大腑秘结，老人、虚人皆可服：肉苁蓉（酒浸，焙）二两，沉香（别研）一两。上为细末，用麻子仁汁打糊为丸，如梧桐子大。每服七十丸，空心用米饮送下。（《济生方》润肠丸）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-cpaycve","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-cpaycve","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑧治高年血液枯槁，大便燥结，胸中作闷：大肉苁蓉三两，白酒浸，洗去鳞甲，切片，白汤三碗，煎一碗，顿服。（《医学广笔记》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-cbkqkks","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-cbkqkks","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑨治消中易饥：肉苁蓉、山茱萸、五味子。为末，蜜丸梧子大。每服盐汤下二十丸。（《医学指南》）"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-v6b1ojb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-v6b1ojb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑩劳伤，精败面黑。用肉苁蓉四两，水煮烂，切薄研细，炖羊肉吃。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-tu880nq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-tu880nq","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑾肾虚白浊。用肉苁蓉、鹿茸、山药、白茯苓，等分为末，加米糊做成丸子，如梧子大，每服三十丸，枣汤送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-vm3zles","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-vm3zles","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⑿汗多便秘（年老或体虚的病人）。用肉苁蓉（酒浸，焙过）二两、沉香末一两，共研为末。加麻子杜汁糊成丸子，如梧子大。每服七、八丸。白开水送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-wusnd0y","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-wusnd0y","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒀消中易饥（按：患此病者常多食，但身体很消瘦）。用肉苁蓉、山萸、五味子等分，共研为末，加蜜做成丸子，如梧子大。每服二十丸，盐酒送下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-opy579l","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-opy579l","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"⒁破伤风（口禁，身强直）。用肉苁蓉切片晒干，烧成烟熏伤处，累效。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-d0c3kyb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-d0c3kyb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-tx21qvx","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-tx21qvx","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中药大辞典》"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-fmypmjk","Type":"NodeHeading","HeadingLevel":2,"Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-fmypmjk","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"《中华本草》：肉苁蓉"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-8xt9y8s","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-8xt9y8s","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拼音注音"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-nd50dfs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-nd50dfs","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" Ròu Cōnɡ Rónɡ"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-mmmd0d9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-mmmd0d9","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"别名"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-9tyvpl8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-9tyvpl8","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉松蓉、黑司令、纵蓉、地精、马足、马芝、大芸、寸芸"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-dlin5be","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-dlin5be","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"英文名"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-xa895fd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-xa895fd","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" all-grass of Desertliving Cistanche"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-13ocgpq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-13ocgpq","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"出处"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-zthnhob","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-zthnhob","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.出自《神农本草经》2.《本草图经》：《本经》云，五月五日采，五月恐已老不堪，故多三月采之。西人多用作食品啖之，刮去鳞甲，以酒净洗去黑汁，薄切，合山芋、羊肉作羹，极美好，益人，食之胜服补药。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-qenfegg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-qenfegg","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"来源"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-qc8vz2a","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-qc8vz2a","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 药材基源：为列当科植物肉苁蓉的肉质茎。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jt83cwh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jt83cwh","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"拉丁植物动物矿物名：Cistanche deserticola Y. C. Ma."}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-0vy6mjv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-0vy6mjv","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"采收和储藏：4-5月上旬采挖刚出土的肉苁黄，留小采大。去掉花序或苁蓉头，晾晒于干将沙滩上或房顶上，1个多月后曲黄白色变成肉质棕褐色，即为甜大芸。秋季采收者因水分大，不易干燥，故把肥大者投入盐湖中，腌1-3年，用时洗去盐分，叫盐大芸。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1yao9vk","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1yao9vk","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"生境分布"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-un58fxl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-un58fxl","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 生态环境：生于海拔225-1150m的荒漠中，寄生在藜科植物梭梭、白梭梭等植物的根上。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-2akyu6e","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-2akyu6e","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"资源分布：分布于内蒙古、陕西、宁夏、甘肃、青海、新疆。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-guhtfy8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-guhtfy8","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"原形态"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-b8d9g8b","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-b8d9g8b","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉苁蓉 多年生寄生草本，高40-160cm。茎肉质，单一或由基部分为2或3枝，下部宽5-15cm，上部渐变细，宽2-5cm。叶多数，鲜片状，螺旋状排列，淡黄白色，无叶柄；下部叶排列紧密，宽卵形或三勿状卵形，长0.5-1cm，宽1-2cm，上部叶稀疏，线状披针形，长1-4cm，宽0.5-1cm，宽1-2cm，上部叶稀疏，线状披针形，长1-4cm，宽0.5-1cm，两面无毛。穗状花序，长15-50cm；苞片1，线状披针形或卵状披针形，长2-4cm，宽0.5-0.8cm，被疏绵毛或近无毛；小苞片2，卵状披针形，与花萼等长或稍长，被疏绵毛或无毛；花萼钟状，长1-1.5cm，5浅裂，裂片近圆珠笔形；花冠筒状钟形，长3-4cm，裂片5，展开，近半圆形；花黄白色、淡紫色，干后变棕褐色，管内有2条纵向的鲜黄色凸起；雄蕊4，二强，近内藏，花丝上部稍弯曲，基部被皱曲长柔毛，花药箭形，被长柔毛；子房上位，基部有黄色密腺，花柱细长，顶端内折，柱头近球形。蒴果卵形，2裂，褐色。种子多数，微小，椭圆状卵形，表面网状，有光泽。花期5-6月，果期6-7月。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-xtx4x9x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-xtx4x9x","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"栽培"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-nsjeyo5","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-nsjeyo5","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.生物学特性 肉苁蓉为寄生植物，寄主为梭梭和白梭等。适于生长沙漠环境。土壤为中细砂，呈中性或偏碱性，含盐分较高。种子多，小而轻，千粒重0.086-0.091g，种子寿命较长。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-oj73n82","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-oj73n82","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.栽培技术 用种子毓殖：可选沙土或半流沙沙漠地带，适宜寄生梭梭生长，利用天然梭梭林较集中的沙不墓了，或培育人工梭梭林，在梭梭林东侧或东南侧方向约50-80cm处挖苗床，苗床大小不等，长1-2m，宽1m左右，深50-80cm，或寄生密集处，可挖一条大苗床沟围线许多株寄生，将种子穴播于苗床上，施骆驼粪、牛羊粪等，覆土30-40cm，上面留沟或苗床坑，以便浇水，播种后保持苗床湿润，诱导寄主根延伸苗床上，春、秋播种，2年间部分床内即有肉苁蓉寄生，少数出土生长，大部分在2-4年内出土，形花结实。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-130ormm","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-130ormm","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.田间管理 沙漠风大，要注意对被风吹裸露的寄主根，进迁培土或用树枝围在寄主根附近防风，苗床要经常浇水保墒，除掉其他植物。肉苁蓉5月开花时，要进行人工授粉，提高结实率。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jjinzcb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jjinzcb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.病虫害防治 病害有白粉病，可用Bo-10生物制剂300倍液或25%粉锈宁4000倍液喷雾防治。根腐病，可松土，发生期用50%多菌灵1000倍液灌根。虫害有种蝇，可用90%敌百虫800倍液或40%乐果乳油1000倍液喷雾或浇灌根部。大沙鼠可用磷化锌或大隆毒铒于洞外诱杀。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-5y1su8m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-5y1su8m","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性状"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-cwdwum4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-cwdwum4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.性状鉴别 茎肉质，长圆柱形，有时稍扁，略弯曲，长3-15cm，直径5-15cm，向上渐细，直径2-5cm，有的切成段，上下直径相近。表面灰棕色或棕褐色，有纵沟，密被覆瓦状排列的肉质鳞叶，鳞叶菱形或三角形，宽0.5-1.5cm，厚约2mm，尚可见鳞叶脱落后留下的弯月形叶迹。质坚实，不易折断。断面棕色，有淡棕色维管束小点，环列成深波状或锯齿状。木部约占4/5，有时中空。表面和断面在光亮处有时可见结晶样小亮点。气微，味甜，略苦。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-755wqd4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-755wqd4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"以条粗壮、密生鳞叶、质柔润者为佳。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-7jpes7m","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-7jpes7m","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"显微鉴别 茎横切面：表皮为1列扁平细胞，外被角质层。皮层由数十列薄壁细胞组成，排列紧密，近维管束处的细胞具纹孔，散有叶迹维管束。维管束处韧型，常16-22个排列成深波状或锯齿状圆环；韧皮部薄壁细胞排列紧密，有时产分成颓废状；形成层不甚明显；木质部可见非木化纤维。射线明显。髓部多分形。皮层及髓部薄壁细胞含淀粉粒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-v3n8r5r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-v3n8r5r","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鳞叶横切面：上下表皮细胞各1列，扁长方形，外被薄角质层。下皮细胞1列，稍大。叶肉组织均为海绵组织，细胞类圆形，壁薄，含叶绿体，细胞间隙小。维管束5-7，外韧型，切向排列。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-o624c8f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-o624c8f","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"化学成分"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-zum9cw1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-zum9cw1","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 肉质茎含肉苁蓉甙（cistanoside）A、B、C、H，洋丁香酚甙（acteoside），2-乙酰基洋丁香酚甙（2-acetylacteoside），海胆甙（echinacoside）七种苯乙醇甙成分，还含鹅掌楸甙（lirio-dendrin），8-表马钱子甙酸（8-epiloganic acid），胡萝卜甙（daucos-terol），甜菜碱（betaine），β-谷甾醇（β-sitosterol），甘露醇（mannitol）[1]，N，N-二甲基甘按酸甲酯（N， N-dimethylglycinemethyl ester）[2]和苯丙氨酸（phenylalanine），缬氨酸（valine），亮氨酸（leucine），异亮氨酸（isoleacine），赖氨酸（lysine），苏氨酸（serine）等十五种氨基酸[3]及琥珀酸（succinic acid），三十烷醇（TCMLIBiacontanol），多糖类[4]。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-kyla3oy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-kyla3oy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"药理作用"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1wpyyac","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1wpyyac","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.对小白鼠免疫功能的影响肉苁蓉水溶液50mg/kg或100mg/kgig给于小鼠观察各项免疫功能指标。结果：脾脏和胸腺重量从85±12和37±6mg/kg增加到140±12和53±6mg/kg；巨噬细胞吞噬率从53±5%增加至78±3%；溶血素和溶血空斑值分别从147±47和0.05±0.1增加为361±62和0.18±0.01；腹腔巨噬细胞内的CAMP含量从100±8.6pmol/ml增加到152±10.9，cGMP含量从62±12（pmol/ml）降低为39±7；提高淋巴细胞转化率，使3H一TdR的参入淋巴细胞的量从178±19（cpm）增加为589±139；使迟发性超敏反应从0.54±0.15（mm）增加力0.82±0.12。表明本品的水溶性成分对小鼠的体液及细胞免疫均有增强作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-b3qti4k","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-b3qti4k","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.对人淋巴细胞E花结形成和酸性a-醋酸萘酚酶酯酶（ANAE）活性的影响:正常人外周血淋巴细胞与药物在体外37℃共温1小时后测定活性E（Ea）和总E（Et）花结率。花结涂片作ANAE染色。结果表明，阳性对照药猪胸腺素F5（500ug/ml）、左旋咪唑（10ug/ml）和黄芪低浓度（5mg/ml）时，补肾药肉苁蓉低浓度（5mg/ml）时均能增加Ea花结率，但对Et花结率无影响。而肉苁蓉高浓度（50mg/ml）时均可降低Et花结率。实验中未见猪胸腺素F5和左旋咪唑能增高ANAE+淋巴细胞百分率，但肉苁蓉在高浓度或低浓度时可降低ANAE+淋巴细胞百分率。可以看出补肾药肉苁蓉在一定浓度下能促进Ea花结形成，E花结试验是测定人T细胞数量的常用方法，一定程度上可反映机体的细胞免疫功能。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-09uwi5f","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-09uwi5f","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.肉苁蓉对小鼠迟发性足垫反应的影响:小鼠ig中药煎液（60%，0.5ml）连续8天，给药d4ipSRBC攻击，24小时后测量足垫肿胀数值。结果表明，肉苁蓉组在攻击后24小时的足垫反应相对强度高于对照组，肉苁蓉在体内有促进细胞免疫功能的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-bi960dd","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-bi960dd","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.对消化系统的作用：4.1.促进排便作用:肉苁蓉各组均能显着缩短小鼠的通便时间，具有促进排便作用。实验同时观察排出粪便的形态，给肉苁蓉各组多为正常或稍大粪粒，个别小鼠（5%）有稀水便发生。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-x32k4j4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-x32k4j4","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.2.对小鼠小肠推动功能的影响:体重33±39雌性小鼠，所用药液及蒸馏水对照液均于给药前混入炭末（用量为药液的5%）。小鼠断食供水16小时后按0.6ml/只ig各供试液，20分钟后处死。剖腹取出小肠测量。以幽门至炭末行进最远处为推进度，幽门至回盲瓣为全长，前者除以后者为推进度。肉苁蓉各组能显着提高小鼠小肠推进度，证明该药能增强肠蠕动，有改善肠肌运动功能的作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1j6uqgg","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1j6uqgg","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.3.肉苁蓉对阿托品抑制排便的对抗作用:取体重42±39雄性小鼠（8mo）和体重46±4g雌性小鼠（8mo）按体重随机分成4组，雌雄各半。断食供水16小时后，单纯给水组按0.15ml/10g体重ig各供试液。记录ip阿托品时间、ig各供试液时间和小鼠排出第一粒红色粪便时间，计算通便时间。结果表明0.025%阿托品对小鼠有明显的抑制排便作用，肉苁蓉能有效地对抗阿托品的这种抑制排便作用，其对抗强度与胃复安相比无显着差异（P＞0.47）。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-kew2po6","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-kew2po6","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.4.肉苁蓉对小鼠大、小肠水分吸收的影响:选取体重43±3g雄性小鼠（8mo）20只，体重43±3g雌性小鼠（8mo）20只，按体重随机分成4组，雌雄各半。断食供水16小时后对照组按0.15ml/10g体重ig蒸馏水，肉苁蓉组ig等量50%肉苁蓉原药材水煎液。给药后3小时、5小时各处死一半小鼠，剖腹，用止血夹夹住大、小肠两端，将大、小肠分离剪下，分别置称量纸上，松开止血夹，立即于天平上称湿重。再于烘箱内105℃干燥2小时后，称取大小肠的干重。表4结果显示给药5小时后，肉苁蓉组大肠含水率与对照组相比差异非常显着，说明肉蓉对大肠的水分吸收具有抑制作用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-l1n5j5i","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-l1n5j5i","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.炮制品的药理作用:不同炮制方法制成的肉苁蓉（炮制方法见化学成分之二），以0.5g/只剂量给于小鼠，共10天，与阳虚（醋酸氢化可的松制成的模型）小鼠肝脾脱氧核糖核酸的合成率进行比较。结果阳虚组的DNA合成率减少，给药治疗组DNA合成率增加，P值分别为\u003c0.05和\u003c0.01等。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-4btobsu","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-4btobsu","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"炮制"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-neihn6p","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-neihn6p","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.肉苁蓉：拣净杂质，清水浸泡，每天换水1-2次（如系咸苁蓉，泡尽盐分），润透，切片（纵切），晒干。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-d1exhc7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-d1exhc7","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.酒苁蓉：取苁蓉片，用黄酒拌匀，置罐内密闭，坐水锅中，隔水加热蒸至酒尽为度，取出，晾干。（每肉苁蓉100斤，用黄酒30斤）3.黑豆制：取肉苁蓉用米泔水漂泡3天，每天换水1次，去尽咸味，刮去表面鳞叶，切1.5cm厚的片；然后取黑豆5kg炒香，分成3份，每次取1份掺水和肉苁蓉用微火煮干，取出至半干，再蒸透后晒干，另取黑豆1份同煮，蒸晒，反复3次，晒干即可，每肉苁蓉500kg，用黑豆50kg。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-2lq9kd9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-2lq9kd9","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《雷公炮炙论》：凡使（肉苁蓉），先须用清酒浸一宿，至明，以棕刷刷去沙土浮甲尽，劈破中心，去白膜一重如竹丝草样，却蒸，从午至酉出，又用酥炙得所。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-xw7zijs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-xw7zijs","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"鉴别"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-hs1xh28","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-hs1xh28","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 理化鉴别 （1）取本品粉末0.5g，加70%乙醇5ml，水浴温热10min，滤过。滤液蒸干，加冰醋酸1ml倾入试管中，沿管壁加硫酸1ml，两液界面有棕红色环。（检查甾类）（2）取本品粉末0.5g，加1%盐酸溶液5ml，水浴温热20min，滤过。滤液加碘化铋钾试剂，生成棕红色沉淀。（检查生物碱）(3)薄层色谱 取本品粉末1g，加乙醇10ml浸渍2h，滤过。滤液蒸干，以1ml乙醇溶解，作供试液。另取甘露醇，加乙醇溶使成每毫升含1mg的溶液，作对照品溶液。取上述二溶液各10μm，分别点样于同一硅胶H薄板上，用正丁醇-冰醋酸乙醇-水（4：1：1：2）展开，展距12cm，取出晾干后，喷雾10%硝酸铈铵乙醇溶液显色。供试液色谱与对照品色谱相应位置上有相同的棕黄色斑点。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-p48s6qv","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-p48s6qv","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"归经"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-h5wyps1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-h5wyps1","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 归肾；大肠经"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-s4kzo21","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-s4kzo21","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"性味"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-uzrt3dy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-uzrt3dy","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 味甘；咸；性温"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-arpfhaq","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-arpfhaq","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"注意"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-0ljac51","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-0ljac51","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 胃弱便溏，相火旺者忌服。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-otk96hs","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-otk96hs","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"1.《本草蒙筌》：忌经铁器。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-dsygyb1","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-dsygyb1","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《本草经疏》：泄泻禁用，肾中有热，强阳易兴而精不固者忌之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1zpw1f7","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1zpw1f7","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药品化义》：相火旺，胃肠弱者忌用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-j6r4gv8","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-j6r4gv8","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《得配本草》：忌铜、铁。火盛便闭、心虚气胀，皆禁用。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jez5f2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jez5f2n","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"功能主治"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-3i474us","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-3i474us","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 补肾阳；益精血；润肠道。主肾阳虚衰；精血不足之阳痿；遗精；白浊；尿频余沥；腰痛脚弱；耳鸣目花；月经衍期；宫寒不孕；肠燥便秘"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-h3g1nsf","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-h3g1nsf","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"用法用量"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-o4eluur","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-o4eluur","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 内服：煎汤，10-15g；或入丸、散；或浸酒。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-jpfbgf2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-jpfbgf2","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"复方"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-0554fk2","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-0554fk2","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.济川煎(《景岳全书·新方八阵》)，主治肾虚气弱，大便不通，小便清长，腰酸背冷。2.3.无比山药丸(《备急千金要方》)，健脾益胃，培元滋肾，主治虚劳损伤，肌体消瘦，腰酸膝软，目暗耳鸣，饮食无味。4.加味四斤丸(《三因极一病证方论》)，主治肝肾不足，热淫于内，筋骨痿软，行走无力，腰膝酸软，潮热时作，饮食无味。5.菟丝子丸(《太平惠民和剂局方》)，主治肾气虚损，五劳七伤，少腹拘急，四肢气短、夜梦惊恐，精神困倦，喜怒无常，小便清长，房室不举等。6.菟丝子散(《医宗必读》)，主治膀胱虚寒，小便不禁或过多。7.肉苁蓉丸(《医心方》)，主治男子五劳七伤，阳痿不起，小便淋漓，尿色赤黄。8.参茸丸(《全国中药成药处方集》)，主治体虚神疲，耳鸣心悸，遗精早泄，贫血萎黄，神经衰弱。9.润肠丸(《世医得效方》)，主治津液亏少，大便秘结。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-1xjkgtb","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-1xjkgtb","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"各家论述"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-lvcvi0x","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-lvcvi0x","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 1.《本经》：主五劳七伤，补中，除茎中寒热痛，养五脏，强阴，益精气，妇人症瘕。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-qauz27r","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-qauz27r","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"2.《别录》：除膀胱邪气、腰痛，止痢。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-nqr0763","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-nqr0763","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"3.《药性论》：益髓，悦颜色，延年，治女人血崩，壮阳，大补益，主赤白下。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-n53n7fn","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-n53n7fn","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"4.《日华子本草》：治男绝阳不兴，女绝阴不产，润五脏，长肌肉，暖腰膝，男子泄精，尿血，遗沥，带下阴痛。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-bqvihkp","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-bqvihkp","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"5.《本草经疏》：白酒煮烂顿食，治老人便燥闭结。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-goexxwo","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-goexxwo","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"6.《本草经疏》:肉苁蓉，滋肾补精血之要药，气本微温，相传以为热者误也。甘能除热补中，酸能入肝，咸能滋肾，肾肝为阴，阴气滋长，则五脏之劳热自退，阴茎中寒热痛自愈。肾肝足，则精血日盛，精血盛则多子。妇人症瘕，病在血分，血盛则行，行则症瘕自消矣。膀胱虚，则邪客之，得补则邪气自散，腰痛自止。久服则肥健而轻身，益肾肝补精血之效也，若曰治痢，岂滑以导滞之意乎，此亦必不能之说也。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-wwjo0ib","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-wwjo0ib","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"7.《本草汇言》：肉苁蓉，养命门，滋肾气，补精血之药也。男子丹元虚冷而阳道久沉，妇人冲任失调而阴气不治，此乃平补之剂，温而不热，补而不峻，暖而不燥，滑而不泄，故有从容之名。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-91nqjct","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-91nqjct","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"8.《本经逢原》：肉苁蓉，《本经》主劳伤补中者，是火衰不能生土，非中气之本虚也。治妇人症瘕者，咸能软坚而走血分也。又苁蓉止泄精遗溺，除茎中热痛，以其能下导虚火也。老人燥结，宜煮粥食之。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-0o9hc4w","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-0o9hc4w","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"9.《玉楸药解》：肉苁蓉，暖腰膝，健骨肉，滋肾肝精血，润肠胃结燥。凡粪粒坚小，形如羊屎，此土湿木郁，下窍闭塞之故。谷滓在胃，不得顺下，零星传送，断落不联，历阳明大肠之燥，炼成颗粒，秘涩难通，总缘风木枯槁，疏泄不行也。一服地黄、龟胶，反益土湿，中气愈败矣。肉苁蓉滋木清风，养血润燥，善滑大肠，而下结粪，其性从容不迫，未至滋湿败脾，非诸润药可比。方书称其补精益髓，悦色延年，理男子绝阳不兴，女子绝阴不产，非溢美之词。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-eiimnkc","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-eiimnkc","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"10.《本草求真》：肉苁蓉，诸书既言峻补精血，又言力能兴阳助火，是明因其气温，力专滋阴，得此阳随阴附，而阳自见兴耳。惟其力能滋补，故凡症瘕积块，得此而坚即消。惟其滋补而阳得助，故凡遗精茎痛，寒热时作，亦得因是而除。若谓火衰至极，用此甘润之品，同于桂、附，力能补阳，其失远矣。况此既言补阴，而补阴又以苁蓉为名，是明因其功力不骤，气专润燥，是亦宜于便闭，而不宜于胃虚之人也。谓之滋阴则可，谓之补火正未必然。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-ugksqmj","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-ugksqmj","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"11.《本草正义》：肉苁蓉，《本经》主治，皆以藏阴言之，主劳伤补中，养五脏，强阴，皆补阴之功也。茎中寒热痛，则肾脏虚寒之病，苁蓉厚重下降，直入肾家，温而能润，无燥烈之害，能温养精血而通阳气，故曰益精气。主症瘕者，咸能软坚，而入血分，且补益阴精，温养阳气，斯气血流利而否塞通矣。《别录》除膀胱邪气，亦温养而水府寒邪自除。腰者肾之府，肾虚则腰痛，苁蓉益肾，是以治之。利，今木皆作痢，是积滞不快之滞下，非泄泻之自利，苁蓉滑肠，痢为积滞，宜疏通而不宜固涩，滑以去其着，又能养五脏而不专于攻逐，则为久痢之中气己虚，而积滞未尽者宜之，非通治暑湿热滞之痢疾也。苁蓉为极润之品，市肆皆以盐渍，乃能久藏，古书皆称其微温，而今则为咸味久渍，温性已化除净绝，纵使漂洗极淡，而本性亦将消灭无余，故古人所称补阴兴阳种种功效，俱极薄弱，盖已习与俱化，不复可以本来之质一例论矣。但咸味能下降，滑能通肠，以主大便不爽，颇得捷效，且性本温润，益阴通阳，故通腑而不伤津液，尤其独步耳。自宋以来，皆以苁蓉主遗泄带下，甚且以主血崩溺血，盖以补阴助阳，谓为有收摄固阴之效。要知滑利之品，通导有余，奚能固涩，《本经》除阴中寒热痛，正以补阴通阳，通则不痛耳。乃后人引申其义，误认大补，反欲以通利治滑脱，谬矣。"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-d4i0g9o","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-d4i0g9o","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"摘录"}]},{"ID":"20240607123235-5zsdyvh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123235-5zsdyvh","updated":"20240607123235"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":" 《中华本草》"}]},{"ID":"20240607123237-82poqwc","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240607123237-82poqwc"}},{"ID":"20240607123238-7pa5i6n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240607123238-7pa5i6n"}}]}